{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51320","headline":"句 · 陆贽","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（贽爲渭南尉有诗云云。\n盖县内多流泉。\n）姜泉流渺渺，夹砌树阴阴。\n（宋敏求《长安志》十七《渭南县》。\n）（今按：《全唐诗》引《唐语林》，谓任江淮尉题廰诗句。\n第一句不同，第二句「夹」误「来」。\n〖此引《长安志》当爲《经训堂丛书》本，《四库全书》本前句作「遶堦流虢㶁」，《唐语林》卷四作「遶阶流助𣵪」，「助𣵪」当作「渺渺\n《记纂渊海》卷二四题作《题姜泉》，前句作「遶街流渺渺」。\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆贽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}